WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:34.190 --> 01:36.260
Vanilla, hurry up, hurry up!

01:37.990 --> 01:38.760
Okay!

01:44.630 --> 01:46.600
We made it...

01:47.040 --> 01:51.040
Sorry, Vanilla. It's 'cause I overslept.

01:51.040 --> 01:52.570
Don't worry about it.

01:52.570 --> 01:57.950
I was, like, thinking about
stuff and couldn't get to sleep.

01:57.950 --> 01:58.590
Yeah.

02:05.090 --> 02:06.650
Chocolat-chan...

02:06.650 --> 02:07.960
I'm fine!

02:09.160 --> 02:10.480
Good morning.

02:12.260 --> 02:13.450
Good morning.

02:18.030 --> 02:20.630
Christmas is for Hearts in Love

02:24.170 --> 02:27.280
Chocolat-chan, don't push yourself, okay?

02:27.280 --> 02:29.710
Because, if Pierre takes your...

02:30.080 --> 02:36.250
I know. If a witch has her heart taken
by a magic user, her eternal soul is gone.

02:36.250 --> 02:39.470
In other words, you'd die.

02:42.190 --> 02:44.720
Oh, Chocolat, Vanilla-chan!

02:45.560 --> 02:47.760
Good morning!

02:48.460 --> 02:50.930
Hey, it's almost Christmas, you know?

02:50.930 --> 02:53.230
Chocolat, Vanilla, do you have any plans?

02:55.400 --> 02:57.240
Nothing in... particular...

02:59.010 --> 03:01.410
Then, why don't we throw
a Christmas party together?

03:02.180 --> 03:03.700
Christmas party?

03:04.050 --> 03:06.450
We do this every year.

03:06.450 --> 03:08.520
We each take turns.

03:08.520 --> 03:11.960
Last year was at my house, and the
year before that was at Mayu-chan's place.

03:11.960 --> 03:14.220
Yeah, it was a lot of fun.

03:14.220 --> 03:16.720
And this year we're thinking of inviting guys!

03:18.460 --> 03:21.560
So we were thinking about
having it at your guys' place, Chocolat.

03:21.560 --> 03:22.230
Our place?

03:22.230 --> 03:25.300
It's got a ton of space, right?
And you have a terrace, too!

03:25.870 --> 03:26.680
But...

03:26.680 --> 03:30.690
We can invite your cousins,
Houx and Saule, too.

03:31.210 --> 03:36.240
Is it not the kind of place
we can make a lot of noise at?

03:37.350 --> 03:41.680
Or is it that you have someone you like,
and you want to meet them on Christmas?

03:43.930 --> 03:46.290
No, I don't! I dont have someone at all!

03:46.290 --> 03:47.660
I don't either.

03:47.990 --> 03:50.360
But you're so popular, Vanilla-chan...

03:50.360 --> 03:52.190
I really don't have someone, though.

03:52.630 --> 03:56.230
In that case, good. We don't, either. Right?

03:56.230 --> 03:56.970
Yeah.

03:56.970 --> 03:57.670
...yeah.

03:57.670 --> 03:59.030
So, can we?

03:59.030 --> 04:00.730
Um, it's not...

04:01.640 --> 04:03.340
Fine.

04:03.340 --> 04:05.040
Let's go crazy!

04:05.680 --> 04:06.710
Really?

04:06.710 --> 04:07.580
Then, it's decided!

04:07.580 --> 04:08.680
Okay!

04:08.680 --> 04:09.680
That's great!

04:10.210 --> 04:12.550
Chocolat-chan, is this all right?

04:12.550 --> 04:16.450
Yeah. I kinda feel like throwing a crazy party!

04:16.450 --> 04:18.790
Well, I don't really mind, but...

04:20.110 --> 04:22.720
Oh! That's what she meant!

04:25.830 --> 04:27.490
And over here is even worse...

04:32.030 --> 04:33.700
This place is a dump.

04:46.210 --> 04:48.220
Huh? What?

04:50.220 --> 04:55.230
What should I do? I have to
clean this place up before Christmas?

04:55.230 --> 04:56.590
That's it!

04:56.590 --> 04:57.730
The mail order catalogue!

04:57.730 --> 05:01.230
She actually wants to clean up her room? All right!

05:01.960 --> 05:07.270
I want to clean up, but
Chocolat-chan trashes it three times faster...

05:08.400 --> 05:09.200
There it is!

05:09.640 --> 05:11.070
Cleaning Cloth.

05:11.070 --> 05:14.250
It says it'll return things that have been
scattered about to where they should be.

05:14.540 --> 05:19.250
And there's also the Eraser Mop, and
the Room Vacuum. There's plenty here.

05:19.250 --> 05:21.380
Okay, I'll buy them all!

05:21.380 --> 05:22.650
Bye 'em!

05:22.650 --> 05:24.210
Don't waste your money!

05:27.490 --> 05:28.220
Robin!

05:28.820 --> 05:32.350
Ah, could it be that... You're
giving me a Christmas present?

05:33.130 --> 05:34.860
Thank you, Papa!

05:35.700 --> 05:37.120
Who's your Papa?!

05:37.430 --> 05:41.300
But you're plenty old enough,
although you don't look like it.

05:41.300 --> 05:43.100
I'm not giving you squat!

05:46.410 --> 05:47.680
Mine too?

05:47.680 --> 05:49.620
Chocolat-chan, you idiot!

05:49.620 --> 05:52.150
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

05:52.150 --> 05:52.810
Why are you hitting ME?

05:53.410 --> 05:57.790
At least give Vanilla her
present. (And mine too, hopefully.)

05:58.850 --> 06:02.790
If you two behave
yourselves, you'll get your presents.

06:04.590 --> 06:07.050
I'll just set this "Good Girl" timer,

06:07.050 --> 06:11.050
and this will give you those presents from before on Christmas.

06:11.050 --> 06:13.050
Really?

06:13.370 --> 06:17.900
BUT! If you waste money or
slack off on collecting hearts...

06:20.980 --> 06:23.400
You'll never get those presents.

06:23.750 --> 06:27.910
Well, that was a fake. This one is real.

06:29.420 --> 06:30.650
Fine, I got it.

06:32.550 --> 06:34.760
Okay, I have to get going.

06:34.760 --> 06:36.120
You seem busy.

06:36.420 --> 06:39.460
Yeah, I'm busier than Santa.

06:39.460 --> 06:46.170
If I don't pick up all those lonely
frozen winter hearts, those girls will freeze.

06:49.300 --> 06:55.080
Since I can't be with you,
you'd better be collecting hearts.

06:57.810 --> 07:01.420
Ahh, this means I can't use the mail order catalogue.

07:02.150 --> 07:06.650
What should I do about cleaning?
Do I have to do it myself, after all?

07:07.260 --> 07:10.070
I'm the most unluckiest girl in the world!

07:10.490 --> 07:13.060
Well, it's normal to do it yourself.

07:13.060 --> 07:15.660
Shut up! I'll whup your butt!

07:15.660 --> 07:18.700
Off we go again!

07:21.070 --> 07:24.630
Vanilla, I've thought of a good idea!

07:25.940 --> 07:27.130
A good idea?

07:28.040 --> 07:29.670
It's no better than yesterday.

07:30.040 --> 07:32.010
You've been sleeping the whole time?

07:33.820 --> 07:38.190
So you see, cleaning tools are 530 ecure, right?

07:38.790 --> 07:42.960
So if I just get one pink heart, I can buy them easily.

07:44.530 --> 07:47.810
And since that's not part of the ecure
I've collected already,

07:47.810 --> 07:50.200
it won't be wasting any money, right?

07:50.900 --> 07:52.150
You think?

07:52.500 --> 07:56.700
Robin's busy anyway, he won't notice!

07:59.040 --> 08:00.910
This idea's perfect!

08:03.180 --> 08:07.450
Chocolat getting a pink heart?
You can't just get one so easily.

08:07.450 --> 08:08.680
Shut up!

08:11.020 --> 08:14.790
Ah! I just cleaned that up last night...

08:14.790 --> 08:15.460
Sorry 'bout that.

08:21.800 --> 08:24.770
Whose heart should I get?

08:25.070 --> 08:27.730
Chocolat-chan, you're scary.

08:29.940 --> 08:31.670
Oh, it's Kato.

08:31.670 --> 08:32.740
What's she doing?

08:35.480 --> 08:37.010
Morita, what is it?

08:37.010 --> 08:40.330
She's got some nerve, that girl.

08:40.650 --> 08:42.620
Huh, Kato?

08:42.620 --> 08:46.330
Yeah, she's not my type at all.

08:46.620 --> 08:47.890
Hey!

08:49.440 --> 08:51.090
What'd you just say?!

08:51.590 --> 08:53.430
Crap, she heard us!

08:53.430 --> 08:55.060
Ack, be afraid!

08:57.270 --> 08:59.330
I'm not your type?

08:59.330 --> 09:01.000
W-What?

09:01.000 --> 09:05.100
You have no right to say
that I'm not your type!

09:05.540 --> 09:09.010
Man, this guy pisses me off!

09:10.240 --> 09:12.570
Huh? Morita and Chocolat?

09:13.480 --> 09:17.290
And you don't even have the guts to say it to my face!

09:17.290 --> 09:19.820
You're the one whose got some nerve!

09:20.550 --> 09:21.700
Sorry...

09:21.960 --> 09:25.230
Hey, say it one more time!

09:25.230 --> 09:27.090
You're... not my type.

09:27.090 --> 09:28.430
Huh?

09:28.430 --> 09:32.840
Just... don't stick your face
in mine like that.

09:41.080 --> 09:42.600
Do what you want!

09:44.350 --> 09:48.600
I'm gonna take it! I'm totally
gonna take that guys heart!

09:49.350 --> 09:51.650
Oh, Chocolat-chan...

09:52.150 --> 09:57.160
I wonder how Chocolat-chan can
talk to boys so casually like that?

09:57.630 --> 10:00.630
I wouldn't say it was "casual'' exactly.

10:00.630 --> 10:03.730
It makes me kind of jealous...

10:08.240 --> 10:11.460
How should I take that guy's heart?

10:12.770 --> 10:16.740
Well, considering how you just fought
with him, I wouldn't get your hopes up.

10:17.850 --> 10:21.280
After all, it's impossible for
Chocolat to get a pink heart.

10:23.120 --> 10:26.520
Mouse or frog? Which one is asking for it more?

10:28.660 --> 10:30.490
But you see...

10:30.930 --> 10:34.860
When boys like someone, it seems like
they do things like say they hate them,

10:34.860 --> 10:36.440
and try to bully them.

10:37.030 --> 10:38.450
Really?

10:39.070 --> 10:44.010
Yeah. A while back, Oezumi-kun and Kitajima-kun...

10:44.010 --> 10:45.040
Yay!

10:45.040 --> 10:46.110
Give that back!

10:47.010 --> 10:48.330
No way!

10:49.240 --> 10:51.500
They did awful things to me, and I cried.

10:51.850 --> 10:54.460
I'll whup their butts!

10:54.920 --> 11:00.520
But then I asked them
frankly, "Do you really hate me so?"

11:00.520 --> 11:01.490
And when I did...

11:03.220 --> 11:04.630
Hate you?

11:04.630 --> 11:06.470
You're just... annoying.

11:08.530 --> 11:11.260
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

11:14.600 --> 11:15.740
Wand!

11:16.300 --> 11:18.540
Hearts, hearts, come to me!

11:28.620 --> 11:29.950
Eh?

11:31.090 --> 11:33.460
That's my Vanilla-chama.

11:34.060 --> 11:37.430
So maybe Morita-kun...

11:37.430 --> 11:38.690
I see!

11:38.690 --> 11:43.030
Alright, I'm gonna try it!

11:54.880 --> 11:57.780
So you see, life-forms that aren't from earth...

11:57.780 --> 11:58.980
Oh, Kato!

11:59.250 --> 12:02.450
This years Christmas party is at your place, I heard.

12:03.420 --> 12:05.790
Arisa invited us earlier.

12:03.880 --> 12:05.790
First, let's try it on him.

12:05.790 --> 12:06.490
Akira!

12:06.990 --> 12:10.460
Do you really hate me? You do, don't you?

12:10.460 --> 12:12.730
It's not that I hate you, it's more...

12:12.730 --> 12:13.630
I'm scared of you.

12:15.600 --> 12:18.600
Crap, I've been the one being the bully.

12:18.600 --> 12:20.330
Excuse me, can I borrow someone?

12:22.240 --> 12:27.140
Will someone please help me carry
the textbooks and maps for the next class?

12:28.710 --> 12:30.140
Morita-kun, please.

12:30.710 --> 12:32.310
Okay.

12:32.310 --> 12:34.650
And one more...

12:35.520 --> 12:37.150
Me! Me, me, me!

12:38.650 --> 12:40.690
Okay, Kato-san then.

12:41.290 --> 12:42.560
Okay!

12:48.400 --> 12:50.060
I'm counting on you!

12:56.040 --> 12:57.040
Hey!

12:57.940 --> 12:59.070
What do you want?

12:59.740 --> 13:02.940
Don't walk so fast!

13:02.940 --> 13:05.800
I'm carrying all these heavy maps!

13:06.210 --> 13:09.150
These are really heavy, too.

13:09.820 --> 13:13.100
I don't really care. Take your time.

13:14.760 --> 13:16.150
That guy...

13:16.590 --> 13:17.960
When boys like someone,

13:17.960 --> 13:22.250
it seems like they do things like say they hate them, and try to bully them.

13:22.250 --> 13:24.900
Morita, Morita!

13:26.870 --> 13:27.930
What?

13:28.800 --> 13:31.100
Do you really hate me?

13:39.510 --> 13:40.420
Alright!

13:41.180 --> 13:42.780
Agrandissment!

13:42.780 --> 13:45.750
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

13:45.750 --> 13:50.840
Your heart... Pick up!

14:06.110 --> 14:08.440
I finally took it, but it's only a pee.

14:08.440 --> 14:11.450
I guess I only surprised him.

14:11.450 --> 14:12.450
I see.

14:12.750 --> 14:16.620
You know, I've never taken Morita-kun's heart either.

14:17.480 --> 14:21.050
But I thought you've taken the
hearts of all the boys in the class.

14:21.560 --> 14:24.550
I think Morita-kun has a girl that he likes.

14:27.460 --> 14:30.400
Chocolat, I need to speak with you.

14:31.100 --> 14:33.700
Huh? Cancelling the party?

14:35.740 --> 14:37.000
Why?

14:37.000 --> 14:37.850
Yeah...

14:38.210 --> 14:41.860
Well, you and Morita-kun
seem to be getting kind of close...

14:42.280 --> 14:45.110
Don't you have some sort of
Christmas date together with him?

14:45.110 --> 14:46.860
Huh? Morita?

14:47.180 --> 14:50.020
It seemed that way this morning, too.

14:50.020 --> 14:51.550
And just before...

14:51.550 --> 14:58.030
No way. He said I wasn't his type and
it made me angry... We were fighting!

14:58.030 --> 15:00.490
And before wasn't anything...

15:00.490 --> 15:03.560
What makes you think we get along, exactly?

15:04.030 --> 15:06.050
But... Well...

15:06.050 --> 15:10.340
Maybe, Mayu-chan... You like Morita?!

15:10.340 --> 15:12.070
Don't yell it like that!

15:13.740 --> 15:15.050
Really?

15:15.410 --> 15:18.910
Yeah, for a long time.

15:18.910 --> 15:22.350
I've wanted to tell him, but I'm kind of scared.

15:22.350 --> 15:24.580
I just could never get the courage.

15:25.320 --> 15:28.990
Mayu-chans heart, it's such a pretty pink.

15:28.990 --> 15:33.570
Girls' hearts can sparkle just
as bright as anyone's, I guess.

15:33.990 --> 15:36.700
Alright, let's invite Morita to the party!

15:38.370 --> 15:40.500
We'll give you a chance, so confess to him!

15:42.240 --> 15:44.370
I can't do something like that...

15:44.370 --> 15:47.470
Mayu-chan, you've got to at least try it!

15:47.470 --> 15:48.880
Have courage!

15:49.480 --> 15:50.170
But...

15:50.740 --> 15:55.780
We'll get you two alone together, and
then just look him straight in the eyes.

15:55.780 --> 15:56.220
Okay?

15:57.890 --> 15:59.290
Can I do it?

15:59.290 --> 16:01.090
I'm sure you can!

16:03.020 --> 16:04.020
Let's go.

16:05.490 --> 16:09.200
Chocolat-chan, I'm sorry.
I said some weird things before.

16:11.370 --> 16:12.800
Don't worry about it!

16:18.490 --> 16:20.040
Here, take it.

16:20.410 --> 16:23.040
You'd better come, or I'll whup your butt!

16:25.780 --> 16:26.880
What's this?

16:26.880 --> 16:29.380
Dear Morita

16:26.880 --> 16:29.380
There's a Christmas

16:26.880 --> 16:29.380
party at my house tomorrow.

16:26.880 --> 16:29.380
Make sure to come!!

16:34.860 --> 16:37.550
In the end I have to do it myself.

16:38.030 --> 16:41.730
It's totally impossible to buy any cleaning
tools with just one pee colored heart.

16:43.800 --> 16:45.830
Stop gawking and start cleaning!

16:46.830 --> 16:48.730
Um, Chocolat-chan...

16:49.070 --> 16:52.040
You're already done cleaning the living room?

16:52.040 --> 16:52.740
Yeah.

16:53.310 --> 16:56.840
And I found these pink hearts.

16:56.840 --> 16:57.740
Want to use them?

16:58.580 --> 17:00.240
That's my Vanilla...

17:01.020 --> 17:04.450
That's it! Can we buy something else, instead?

17:19.970 --> 17:21.370
Ready, set...

17:25.910 --> 17:28.480
Wow! They're so cute!

17:28.480 --> 17:30.640
Thank you, Robin-sensei!

17:33.410 --> 17:35.490
Good evening!

17:36.100 --> 17:38.040
Merry Christmas!

17:38.380 --> 17:40.180
Merry Christmas!

17:41.520 --> 17:43.060
Welcome, everyone.

17:43.560 --> 17:45.360
Mayu-chan, you can do it.

17:45.360 --> 17:46.060
Yeah.

17:52.500 --> 17:54.070
Merry Christmas!

17:55.880 --> 17:57.340
Whoa, awesome!

17:58.070 --> 18:00.300
Merry Christmas!

18:02.680 --> 18:03.840
Hiroshi, you came too!

18:14.960 --> 18:18.620
Now, now, Morita, have a seat.
Next to Mayu-chan.

18:20.430 --> 18:22.560
Ooh, that chicken looks good!

18:26.530 --> 18:28.000
Damn him...

18:31.310 --> 18:33.070
What are you doing, Hiroshi?

18:34.410 --> 18:36.040
Hiroshi, you're weird!

18:37.510 --> 18:40.080
Here, hot chocolate.

18:41.350 --> 18:43.220
Mayu-chan, take one to Morita-kun.

18:51.090 --> 18:53.360
You keep getting in my way!

18:54.760 --> 18:56.860
Oh, Morita.

18:57.300 --> 19:00.200
Can you get the box of fruit from outside?

19:00.970 --> 19:02.870
What, am I your servant?

19:11.650 --> 19:14.350
Mayu-chan, this time, make certain to do it.

19:17.890 --> 19:19.010
Don't worry, I'll go!

19:19.010 --> 19:20.920
It's cold outside, so stay here.

19:22.460 --> 19:24.860
Just let her go, all right!

19:24.860 --> 19:26.290
Why?

19:26.290 --> 19:29.890
Ah, it's because outside are
your alien friends and their UFOs!

19:30.230 --> 19:31.730
You can't hide them forever!

19:31.730 --> 19:33.400
Whatever, just come with us.

19:33.400 --> 19:35.700
Let's play together, okay?

19:53.790 --> 19:55.590
Morita-kun.

20:03.830 --> 20:07.030
Mayu-chan's heart is a really pretty pink.

20:08.840 --> 20:13.110
Morita-kun, how do you feel about me?

20:15.940 --> 20:18.250
Do you hate me?

20:18.250 --> 20:19.250
No...

20:19.250 --> 20:25.420
Really? But you always
avoid looking at me, Morita-kun.

20:25.920 --> 20:29.060
That's... I... Sorry.

20:29.060 --> 20:31.730
Whenever I look at you, my heart beats faster...

20:31.730 --> 20:35.730
I just didn't know what to do.

20:35.730 --> 20:41.030
So I probably... love you.

20:44.370 --> 20:47.970
Me too. I love you.

20:50.280 --> 20:54.510
Those two feel the same about each other.

20:57.250 --> 21:00.480
Let's give those two a Christmas present.

21:01.320 --> 21:02.320
Ready, set...

21:06.190 --> 21:08.260
A Santa Cracker!

21:08.260 --> 21:13.080
I'm glad we bought these Santa
Crackers from the mail order catalogue.

21:25.080 --> 21:28.050
What's going on? Is this a dream? A vision?

21:28.050 --> 21:31.150
Whatever, it's Christmas, after all!

21:38.490 --> 21:41.300
What's this! Awesome, awesome!

21:41.300 --> 21:42.360
Did you see that, Hiroshi?

21:45.600 --> 21:48.340
Chocolat-chan, let's go back inside.

21:48.340 --> 21:50.400
Sure, go on ahead.

21:50.400 --> 21:51.400
Okay.

21:54.070 --> 21:58.250
For a person you love to
love you back just the same...

21:58.250 --> 22:02.020
It's wonderful, and really warms my heart.

22:02.020 --> 22:03.720
Something really beautiful.

22:04.460 --> 22:09.060
It's something impossible for
a witch to experience, maybe...

22:23.200 --> 22:29.530
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.620 --> 22:31.030
"Love"

22:31.940 --> 22:35.450
A magic spell.

22:37.580 --> 22:44.860
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.290 --> 22:54.360
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:56.040 --> 23:00.310
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.910 --> 23:03.970
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.280 --> 23:11.350
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.720 --> 23:16.160
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.160 --> 23:26.270
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.330 --> 23:35.240
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.080 --> 23:48.400
It's almost time for New Year's fun!

23:48.400 --> 23:52.200
New Year's in the Magical World is crazy fun!

23:52.200 --> 23:54.090
Let's play to our heart's content!

23:54.090 --> 23:58.790
Huh? Queen Candidates can't even return to the Magical World on New Year's?

23:58.790 --> 24:00.670
I can't believe this!

24:00.670 --> 24:06.170
Fine then, I'll just have to have as much fun as possible in the Human World's New Year's!

24:06.900 --> 24:08.750
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.750 --> 24:11.450
A small heart, a deep red heart.

24:11.450 --> 24:13.440
If you don't watch, I'll whup your butt!

24:13.440 --> 24:14.160
Thanks!
